#!/bin/bash
set -euo pipefail
mkdir -p /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/backbone_bb1
docker run --rm --name dqc36-bb1-$$ --memory=64g --memory-swap=64g --cpus=2 -v "/srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude:/srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude" -w "/srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36" python:3.12 bash -c "set -e; trap \"chown -R 1000:1000 /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/backbone_bb1\" EXIT; pip -q install shapely numpy pyyaml >/dev/null 2>&1; cd /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-mesh5-1029/src/results/qc_clock_physical_1029; python /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/dqc36_backbone.py --jog-src /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-mesh5-1029/src/results/qc_clock_physical_1029 --fixed-wires /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/prebuild_e1_resite_noaccess/fixed_wires.json --old-tree /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-1029/baseline26/trial26/clock/tree.json --new-tree /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/resite/tree_resite.json --netlist /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-import-0824/reachfix/mechanics/clkonly.v --lef /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-physical-1029/inputs/cells.lef --cell-windows /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-1029/baseline26/islands119_cellmap/cell_windows.json --geometry /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-mesh5-1029/census119_h800/geometry.json --pg /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-physical-1029/inputs/pg_rects.json --clock-base /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-physical-1029/inputs/clock_base_access26_minarea.json --reserved-metal /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/codex-qc-macropg-1029/bridges_v1/reserved_bridges.json --max-jog 1.5 --out /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/backbone_bb1 > /srv/opentallas-scratch2/claude/die-qc36/backbone_bb1.log 2>&1"
